          "text": "Description: On December 26, 1978, around 10:45 PM, a witness observed the movements of a luminous object in the sky. Passing through a cloud, this object emitted a light phenomenon and rose rapidly into the sky, taking on a red color. The witness would then only see a red dot disappear. No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon.",
